WEBVTT

47:10.917 --> 47:12.667
Apparently, they're planning
for a second child.

47:13.417 --> 47:15.250
She doesn't even take my calls anymore.

47:15.584 --> 47:17.625
-That's how busy he keeps her.
-Enough!

47:19.209 --> 47:20.334
If my aunt were alive…

47:21.667 --> 47:22.625
she wouldn't have agreed to this.
